      "disclosure": {
        "level": "standard",
        "initially_visible": true
      }
    },
    {
      "block_id": "p-10",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "*   **Extension Host Unit Tests**: Use `vscode-test` to mock workspace and commands. *   **Integration Tests**: Scripted VSCodium instances connecting to a real `rig-relay` daemon. *   **Shadow Projections**: Compare the extension's view of a turn with the daemon's internal `CodingSessionSnapshot` to ensure no data leakage.",
      "disclosure": {
        "level": "standard"
      }
    }
